 "main_finding": "Notion Desktop is a thin Electron shell over the same web app shipped in a browser. Its entire native value is a small feature set: a global-hotkey Quick Search overlay window (8 dedicated notion:quick-search-* IPC channels + a quickSearchController state slice), a local SQLite cache served by a dedicated SqliteServer child process (better-sqlite3) with a built-in SQL browser devtool, tab/window management, native clipboard formats, and menu-bar presence. Everything else is a webcontents view of notion.so."
}